  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/種] 耐暑性；中\n[おぎはら楽天/種] 耐湿性: 普 通 高温多湿は苦手です。水はけ良い用土で（蒸れ 中 相当）\n[おぎはら楽天/種] 日照 寒冷地: やや半日陰〜半日陰／暖地: 半日陰（西日 × 相当）\n[MBG/品種] Foliage may depreciate considerably in hot summer weather and may scorch if grown in too much sun.\n[MBG/品種] Although plants tolerate light morning sun, they need afternoon shade.\n[MBG/品種] Leaves can depreciate considerably in extremely hot weather and/or too much sun (scorch).\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: West-facing or East-facing or North-facing",
